The amended provisions of Article 58-2 (1) shall apply where any executive or employee of a specialized agency divulges or pirates confidential information known to him or her in the scope of his or her duties with regard to an invention claimed in a pending patent application (including an invention claimed in a pending international patent application) after this Act enters into force.
