The amended provisions of Article 99-2 shall apply to any patent registered as granted to an unentitled person after this Act enters into force.
Article 9 (Applicability to Extinguishment of Patents Owned by Corporations in Process of Liquidation)
The amended provisions of Article 124 (2) shall apply to the patents owned by a corporation whose liquidation process is registered as completed after this Act enters into force.
Article 10 (Applicability to Petitions for Patent Revocation)
The amended provisions of Chapter VI-2 (Articles 132-2 through 132-15) shall apply to the patents the grant of which is registered after this Act enters into force.
